
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Music Pro</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
body{background:#080808;color:#fff}
nav{height:75px;padding:0 7%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #222}
.logo{font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;color:#1ed760}
nav a{color:#aaa;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}
.hero{min-height:480px;padding:100px 8%;display:flex;align-items:center;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 40%,#17472b 0%,#101810 35%,#080808 75%)}
.hero-content{max-width:650px}
.tag{color:#1ed760;letter-spacing:3px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:25px}
h1{font-size:clamp(45px,7vw,82px);line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:25px;letter-spacing:-3px}
h1 span{color:#1ed760}
.hero p{color:#aaa;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;max-width:520px}
.status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:#153d25;border:1px solid #28663c;color:#1ed760;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:30px;margin-top:30px;font-size:13px}
.dot{width:8px;height:8px;background:#1ed760;border-radius:50%}
section{padding:75px 8%}
.section-title{font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px}
.subtitle{color:#888;margin-bottom:35px;line-height:1.6}
.benefits{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.card{background:#151515;border:1px solid #292929;padding:28px;border-radius:14px;min-height:180px}
.card .number{color:#1ed760;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:25px}
.card h3{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px}
.card p{font-size:14px;color:#888;line-height:1.6}
.membership{background:#151515;border:1px solid #292929;border-radius:16px;padding:35px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
.membership p{color:#888;font-size:14px;margin-top:10px}
.membership h2{font-size:25px}
.plan{color:#1ed760;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px}
footer{border-top:1px solid #222;padding:30px 8%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#777;font-size:13px}
footer a{color:#aaa;text-decoration:none}
@media(max-width:700px){
.hero{padding:80px 7%;min-height:420px}
.benefits{grid-template-columns:1fr}
section{padding:55px 7%}
.membership{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}
footer{gap:15px;flex-direction:column}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
    <div class="logo">♫ MUSIC PRO</div>
    <a href="/home">← Back to Music</a>
</nav>

<div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="tag">YOUR MUSIC. YOUR RULES.</div>
        <h1>Music without <span>limits.</span></h1>
        <p>Welcome to Music Pro. Enjoy your music experience with premium features, uninterrupted listening and complete control.</p>
        <div class="status">
            <span class="dot"></span>
            PRO MEMBERSHIP ACTIVE
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<section>
    <h2 class="section-title">The Pro Experience</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Everything you need for a better music experience.</p>

    <div class="benefits">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="number">01 / LISTEN</div>
            <h3>Ad-free Music</h3>
            <p>Enjoy your favourite tracks without interruptions.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="number">02 / QUALITY</div>
            <h3>High Quality Audio</h3>
            <p>Experience your music with better sound quality.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="number">03 / CONTROL</div>
            <h3>Unlimited Skips</h3>
            <p>Skip tracks and enjoy music your own way.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="number">04 / FREEDOM</div>
            <h3>Offline Listening</h3>
            <p>Save your favourite music for listening offline.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="number">05 / DISCOVER</div>
            <h3>Explore More</h3>
            <p>Discover music and create your own playlists.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="number">06 / PREMIUM</div>
            <h3>Exclusive Experience</h3>
            <p>Make your music experience truly yours.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <div class="membership">
        <div>
            <div class="plan">YOUR MEMBERSHIP</div>
            <h2>Music Pro Monthly</h2>
            <p>Your premium membership is currently active.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="plan">ACTIVE ✓</div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <div>♫ MUSIC PRO</div>
    <a href="/home">Back to Home</a>
    <div>Made for music lovers.</div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
